//yura-guard.npc

*E_NAME		"Eura Guard"

*E_CHAT		"Due to heavy snow, you can not go   further. I have orders to restrict  entry into the area."
*E_CHAT		"You are a great warrior who made    this far but due to heavy snow, you cannot go further."
*E_CHAT		"Go back to Eura village, you could  be trapped by snow."
*E_CHAT		"They say that the monsters in the   ice fields are much stronger than in the iron fields."